@startuml
!include _style.puml
title Заявка — основные реализованные переходы
state "awaiting_reply" as Awaiting
state "estimate_shared" as Estimate
state "accepted" as Accepted
state "declined" as Declined
state "cancelled" as Cancelled
state "no_show" as NoShow
state "closed" as Closed
[*] --> Awaiting : create / request bookingMode
[*] --> Accepted : create / instant bookingMode\nslot + capacity + resource reservation
Awaiting --> Estimate : provider sends quote
Estimate --> Estimate : provider sends next revision\nprevious pending quote → superseded
note right of Estimate
  Чтение показывает последние 50 версий (DESC limit,
  затем ASC для клиента). Актуальная версия всегда в конце
  quoteHistory и соответствует status в quote snapshot.
  Решение по старой quoteId/version получает 409.
end note
Estimate --> Accepted : client accepts current quote\nquoteId + version / expiry / capacity
Estimate --> Declined : client declines quote
Estimate --> Awaiting : quote expires / expiry handling
Awaiting --> Accepted : provider confirms / visit time + capacity
Estimate --> Accepted : provider confirmation route\nсм. конкретные guards в source
Accepted --> Closed : provider completes\nclient + provider confirmations / visit time
Accepted --> NoShow : provider marks no-show / reason
Awaiting --> Cancelled : client / cancellation reason
Estimate --> Cancelled : client / cancellation reason
Accepted --> Cancelled : client / release + bonus refund
note right of Accepted
  Клиентское confirm обновляет clientConfirmedAt,
  само по себе не меняет request.status.
  accepted не тождественно «оба подтвердили».
end note
note bottom of Closed
  Completion → bonus award / trust reassessment.
  Closed + mutual confirmation → verified review eligibility.
end note
note left of Awaiting
  Основной путь. Draft/open совместимость, reschedule и детали
  quote lifecycle требуют request-lifecycle-policy и use cases.
  Это карта навигации, не полный transition allowlist.
end note
footer request-create / request-quote / request-transition / request-reschedule / request-availability
@enduml
